  22              	/**
  23              	 * @mainpage MDR32VF0xI Standard Peripherals Library.
  24              	 * MDR32VF0xI Standard Peripherals Library is a package consisting of
  25              	 * all standard peripheral device drivers for MDR32F02 and MDR1206 microcontrollers.
  26              	 * This library is a firmware package which contains a collection of routines,
  27              	 * data structures and macros covering the features of Milandr MDR32VF0xI
  28              	 * peripherals. It includes a description of the device drivers plus a set of
  29              	 * examples for each peripheral. The firmware library allows any device to be
  30              	 * used in the user application without the need for in-depth study of each
  31              	 * peripherals specifications. Using the Standard Peripherals Library has two
  32              	 * advantages: it saves significant time that would otherwise be spent in
  33              	 * coding, while simultaneously reducing application development and
  34              	 * integration costs.
  35              	 */
